   "body": "**Operator input, 2026-11-11: refocus the mock-ups**\n\nWhat the operator sees today:\n- **Catégories:** the category list is in cards; a category's topic list is **flat**. The operator finds that flat list good.\n- **Favoris:** the list is in cards (sections by category); the topics inside are cards too; then the topic reader has no cards.\n\nDirection: cards are not needed, and pushing them everywhere would look bad. **Option A (messages in cards) is dropped.** Mock instead:\n- **B1. Topic lists flat everywhere:** Favoris (Drapeaux) uses the same flat rows as a category's topic list, keeping its category section headers. The root lists (Catégories, MP list) keep their cards.\n- **B2. Flat everywhere:** the root lists go flat too (Catégories, MP list, profile, drafts).\n\nScreenshots of B1 and B2 next to today, same matrix as above (iPhone, light/dark, regular/compact density, Favoris → topic → MP). The operator then chooses.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
